    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Vutakatifu vwa Masahi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahova yavolera Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "avolere Haruni, na vana veve na avandu vosi va Isiraeli ndi, yili nilio likuva lia Yahova alagi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mundu woosi wa Isiraeli uhaana kihanwa cheng'ombe anoho kememe chi ligondi, anoho imburi hokososa anoho ichova wa hokososa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muvogono vwo kokeleeta ha vwingiliru vwi Lihema liukuvuganira mu na Yahova, aduuki kukihaana kuli kihanwa imbiri wi Lihema lia Yahova, mundu oyo alavalizwa kuva nilihiolo liukutahiza masahi, na alatulizwa hagati ha avandu veve. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kivuni chi lilaga yili keveeye ndi, avandu va Isiraeli kalunu valaleta ku Yahova zinyama zia vasinzira mu viguuti. Kalunu valazileeta ku Musaalisi ha vwingiliru vwi Lihema nukuzisinza kuli vihaanwa vie mirembe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musaalisi aluuha masahi ku uvwali vwa Yahova ha vwingiliru vwi Lihema liukuvuganira mu na Yahova; nokusamba zitinya zifunyi mwayu gwukuyanziza Yahova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avandu va Isiraeli sivadukanaa vazizagiliri kuva vataveeye vasuuvirifu ku Yahova mba, ku lisinzira zinyama mu viguuti kuli vihaanwa nukuvihaana ku mademoni gi zimburi. Avandu va Isiraeli gavadukiraa valindi lilaga kuduuka ku makura gaaza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uvavoolere kandi mundu woosi, wa Isiraeli, anoho mugeni umenyi hagati hinyu, uhaana kihanwa chukusambwa, anoho kihanwa choosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuli kihanwa ku Yahova, naavulia kokeleeta havwingiliru vwi Lihema, mundu oyo kuduuka atulizwi hagati ha avandu va Nyasaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niiva mundu woosi, wa Isiraeli anoho mugeni umenyi hagati hinyu alalia inyama nikikiri mu na masahi, anoho ulia masahi goosi, ndamutuliza hagati ha avandu vange ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Livamwoyo lia vuli kelombe liveeye mu masahi, na yiki nicho chagira Yahova nalaga ndi amasahi goosi gasundulwi ku uvwali kutulizaho uvwoni vwa avandu. Amasahi gaveeye livamwoyo, gakunikaa uvwoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yiki nicho chagira Yahova navolera avandu va Isiraeli anoho vageni vamenya hagati haavo ndi vatalia masahi anoho inyama ikikiri mu namasahi mba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niiva mundu woosi, wa Isiraeli anoho mugeni umenyi hagati haavo uhima inyama anoho linyonyi liveeye lilahi kuduuka atahiziri masahi galio ku lirova ma agakuniki nuluguchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Livamwoyo lia vuli kelombe keveeye mwoyo liveeye mu masahi. Yicho nicho chagira Yahova navolera avandu va Isiraeli ndi vatalia inyama yoosi nigikiri mu na masahi mba. Mundu woosi okola ndio alatulizwaho. Sialavalizwa kuva mulala ku avandu va Nyasaye mba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundu woosi ulia inyama imali kukuza yene anoho yi inyama yindi yu muvulimu yiiti, kuduuka afuuyi zinguvu zizie kandi yisingi na alava mudamanu kuduuka hamugorova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natakola ndio, alanyoola mageri gu vudamanu vwivwe mwene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
